            "Cold stress: deaths",
            "Deaths due to cold weather. These are part of the health burden of cold weather. Cold weather can also worsen chronic conditions, sometimes leading to death. This data only includes deaths directly attributed to cold on death certificates.",
            "Cold stress: emergency department visits",
            "ED visits for cold-related illnesses, such as hypothermia and frostbite. These are part of the health burden of cold weather. Cold weather can also make chronic conditions worse.",
            "Cold stress: hospitalizations",
            "Hospitalizations for cold-related illnesses, such as hypothermia and frostbite. These are part of the health burden of cold weather. Cold weather can also make chronic conditions worse.",
            "Cold stress: 5-year emergency department visits",
            "ED visits for cold-related illnesses, such as hypothermia and frostbite. These are part of the public health burden of cold weather. Cold weather can also make chronic conditions worse.",
            "Cold stress: 5-year hospitalizations",
            "Hospitalizations for cold-related illnesses, such as hypothermia and frostbite. These are part of the public health burden of cold weather. Cold weather can also make chronic conditions worse.",
            "Heat events",
            "Days over 90 degrees. More people die due to extreme heat than all other extreme weather events combined. As the climate continues to warm, we can expect more severe and more frequent heat events.",
            "Heat stress: deaths",
            "Deaths directly attributed to heat, according to death certificates. Hot weather kills more people than all other extreme weather combined. This measure represents a small proportion of all heat-related deaths.",
            "Heat stress: yearly emergency department visits",
            "ED visits due to heat-related illnesses, such as heat stroke and heat exhaustion. These represent part of the public health burden of extreme heat.",
            "Heat stress: 5-year emergency department visits",
            "ED visits due to heat-related illnesses, such as heat stroke and heat exhaustion. These are part of the public health burden of extreme heat.",
            "Heat stress: yearly hospitalizations",
            "Hospitalizations due to heat stress. These are part of the public health burden of hot weather.",
            "Heat stress: 10-year hospitalizations",
            "Hospitalizations due to hot weather. These are part of the public health burden due to hot weather. Data aggregated over 10 years provides enough stablility to display neighborhood impacts.",
            "Heat vulnerability index",
            "The risk of community-level heat impacts like deaths due to extreme heat events. The HVI is made from data on surface temperature, green space, air conditioning access, median income, and Black population (the population most excluded from heat resources). Differences in community-level heat impacts stem from structural racism, which limits access to preventive resources.",
            "Heat vulnerability index (NTA)",
            "The risk of community-level heat impacts, like deaths, due to extreme heat events. The HVI is made up of data on surface temperature, green space, air conditioning access, median income, and Black population (the population most excluded from heat resources). Differences in community-level heat impacts stem from structural racism, which limits access to preventive resources.",
